[00:00.000]...
[00:15.986]Got over it ages ago
{"早已释怀"}
[00:19.273]Where we were from the same river
{"我们曾同饮一江水"}
[00:22.877]Thinking about how we lost our minds
{"回想当初的疯狂"}
[00:26.562]I don't care what's in the past
{"我不在乎过往云烟"}
[00:30.968]They don't care about old trouble
{"他们不在意旧怨"}
[00:34.266]Many wars wherever you go
{"所到之处战火纷飞"}
[00:37.771]Somebody please!
{"谁来帮帮忙！"}
[00:38.927]Can we stop all the fights?
{"能否停止所有争斗？"}
[00:41.578]I'll do it because it's my turn
{"轮到我了就该担当"}
[00:46.837]Take a step back
{"退后一步"}
[00:48.377]Please face up to reality YES!
{"请直面现实　对！"}
[00:53.468]You don't hear me No!
{"你没在听我　不！"}
[00:56.025]You can change that if you want
{"只要你愿意就能改变"}
[01:00.972]But don't you know?
{"但你难道不明白？"}
[01:03.566]There are people crying everyday
{"每天都有人在哭泣"}
[01:07.250]Let's fly away
{"让我们一起远走高飞"}
[01:09.190]For Earth and Mars today!
{"为了今天的地球与火星！"}
[01:14.143]Don't stop me now
{"现在别阻拦我"}
[01:15.281]Look around the world
{"看看这个世界"}
[01:18.359]How can we stop the war
{"如何才能终结战争"}
[01:21.924]Hello. But Are we sure enough?
{"你好　但我们真有把握吗？"}
[01:25.967]You'll come back tomorrow
{"你明天会回来"}
[01:28.029]But I need to know that
{"但我需要确认"}
[01:30.297]Look around the world
{"看看这个世界"}
[01:33.287]So What are we fighting for?
{"所以我们究竟为何而战？"}
[01:36.396]Can I ask you?
{"我能问你吗？"}
[01:38.697]Why the sky is blue?
{"为何天空是蓝色的？"}
[01:40.860]There's no difference
{"毫无差别"}
[01:42.303]You and me
{"你与我"}
